_output.pci-0000_0a_00.1.hdmi-stereo` を~/.config/pulse/default.paの末尾に書いているので基本これが読まれる状態になっています","ts":"1629439469.216500","edited":{"user":"U028ZMX11E1","ts":"1629439532.000000"},"files":[{"id":"F02BZTMLS0L","created":1629439467,"timestamp":1629439467,"name":"pacmd list-sinks","title":"pacmd list-sinks","mimetype":"text/plain","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"text","pretty_type":"プレーンテキスト","user":"U028ZMX11E1","mode":"snippet","editable":true,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":4133,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BZTMLS0L/pacmd_list-sinks","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BZTMLS0L/download/pacmd_list-sinks","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":0,"thumb_360_h":0,"thumb_480":"","thumb_480_w":0,"thumb_480_h":0,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U028ZMX11E1/F02BZTMLS0L/pacmd_list-sinks","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F02BZTMLS0L-c25bf972c8","edit_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U028ZMX11E1/F02BZTMLS0L/pacmd_list-sinks/edit","preview":"2 sink(s) available.\n  * index: 0\n\tname: \u003calsa_output.pci-0000_0a_00.1.hdmi-stereo\u003e\n\tdriver: \u003cmodule-alsa-card.c\u003e\n\tflags: HARDWARE DECIBEL_VOLUME LATENCY DYNAMIC_LATENCY","preview_highlight":"\u003cdiv class=\"CodeMirror cm-s-default CodeMirrorServer\" oncopy=\"if(event.clipboardData){event.clipboardData.setData('text/plain',window.getSelection().toString().replace(/\\u200b/g,''));event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();}\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"CodeMirror-code\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e2 sink(s) available.\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e  * index: 0\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv