xt","block_id":"4d9Ll"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ccbc1c8-a640-4646-a845-2de603e7bb82","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"DisplayPortはサスペンドがいろいろ難があるので、resume時に動的に情報を取得して再設定とかが必要かも?","ts":"1629428434.211000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bWPZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bbf37a4-a14c-43bd-80ca-bf5f193cba35","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"私もLinuxの音周りはなんもわからんので:iinoyo:","ts":"1629428403.210200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a4U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a39eabe-c2e9-4d42-bb34-27f58c5565a9","type":"message","user":"U028ZMX11E1","text":"質問ばっかりで申し訳ないんですが、音関連でまだわからないことがあります\n同じNvidiaのカードにDisplay PortとHDMIでつないだモニターが1つずつあって、常にDisplay Portの方をモニターから音を出したいのですがどうすればいいのでしょう\n\n同じデバイス番号から出力する意図で `~.asoundrc` に\n```pcm.!default {\n\ttype hw\n\tcard 0\n\tdevice 3\n}\nctl.!default {\n\ttype hw\n\tcard 0\n}```\nと書いていて、初回起動時はいつもdevice 3がDisplay Portの方になっているので大丈夫なのですが、一度サスペンドすると3と7が入れ替わるようです(デバイス番号は``aplay -D plughw:0,3 /usr/share/sounds/alsa/Front_Center.wav` `aplay -D plughw:0,7 /usr/share/sounds/alsa/Front_Center.wav`でどちらのスピーカーから鳴るかを確認しています)\n`aplay -l` の出力はスニペットの内容で、どちらのときも同じ出力になります\nデバイス番号を固定したり他の方法で出力デバイスを固定する方法はないでしょうか\n\nまた、あとからデバイスを切り替える方法はありますか(コマンドでもGUIでも)\n.asoundrcのdeviceを7に切り替えて `alsactl kill rescan` `pulseaudio -k` `pulseaudio --start` を実行しても切り替わらないのでそもそも.asoundrcで切り替えるものではないんですかね……\n\n何もわかってなくてごめんなさい……","ts":"1629428357.209500","edited":{"user":"U028ZMX11E1","ts":"1629428415.000000"},"files":[{"id":"F02BTBRKQCS","created":1629428356,"timestamp":1629428356,"name":"LANG=C aplay -l","title":"LANG=C aplay -l","mimetype":"text/plain","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"text","pretty_type":"プレーンテキスト","user":"U028ZMX11E1","mode":"snippet","editable":true,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":905,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BTBRKQCS/lang_c_aplay_-l","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BTBRKQCS/download/lang_c_aplay_-l","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":0,"thumb_360_h":0,"thumb_480":"","thumb_480_w":0,"thumb_480_h":0,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U028ZMX11E1/F02BTBRKQCS/lang_c_aplay_-l","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F02BTBRKQCS-eb3f2d484e","edit_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U028ZMX11E1/F02BTBRKQCS/lang_c_aplay_-l/edit","preview":"**** List of PLAYBACK Hardware Devices ****\ncard 0: NVidia [HDA NVidia], device 3: HDMI 0 [HDMI 0]\n  Subdevices: 1/1\n  Subdevice #0: subdevice #0\ncard 0: NVidia [HDA NVidia], device 7: HDMI 1 [HDMI 1]","preview_highlight":"\u003cdiv class=\"CodeMirror cm-s-default CodeMirrorServer\" oncopy=\"if(event.clipboardData){event.clipboardData.setData('text/plain',window.getSelection().toString().replace(/\\u200b/g,''));event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();}\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"CodeMirror-code\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e**** List of PLAYBACK Hardware Devices ****\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003ecard 0: NVidia [HDA NVidia], device 3: HDMI 0 [HDMI 0]\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e  Subdevices: 1/1\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003e  Subdevice #0: subdevice #0\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cpre\u003ecard 0: NVidia [HDA NVidia], device 7: HDMI 1 [HDMI 1]\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n","lines":25,"lines_more":20,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null